																								"text": {
																									"value_i18n": {
																										"en_US": "<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"611\">Platform for publishing Microsoft Power BI reports for online viewing on public and private and mobile websites built with Liferay DXP/Portal.</p>\n\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"755\">Access to Azure Entra is configurable per Portal Instance and also per individual Sites/Organizations active in the Portal instance.</p>\n\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"889\">The same configuration granularity is available for Power BI workspaces that can be associated with the portal Instance and also with individual Sites/Organizations.</p>\n\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1056\">The widget is positioned on each page of the Site/Organization and, from the Configuration panel, it is possible to browse the Power BI workspace and choose which report to publish in that widget.</p>\n\n<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1254\">The platform was built and certified for use with Liferay Portal/DXP version 7.4 and can be back ported to older versions of Liferay Portal/DXP.</p>"
																									}
																								}
																							}
																						}
