																										"en_US": "<p>Company profile: Thirty years of activity in the information systems sector are the best reference to entrust your company to.</p>\n\n<p>We have integrated a large amount of technologies to model Internet and intranet systems.</p>\n\n<p>We have a unique expertise on the Liferay platform, which we have been using as the foundation of our projects since 2004.</p>\n\n<p>Today, the powerful and modern Liferay platform allows us to design complex future-oriented and secure integration systems and intranet portals.</p>"
